sequenceDiagram
    %% Predictive 3-Page Redis Caching Sequence (FastAPI + Redis + Silver DB)
    autonumber

    actor Client as API Client / Web Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend (backend/main.py)
    participant Redis as Redis Cache (Port 6379)
    participant Silver as Silver Database (Port 5432)

    Note over Client,Silver: Flow A: Cache HIT on Requested Page
    Client->>API: GET /api/v1/books?page=2&page_size=10
    API->>Redis: GET catalog:books:page:2:size:10
    Redis-->>API: Return Cached Page Payload (JSON)
    Note over API: Attach headers: X-Cache: HIT, X-Cache-Key
    API-->>Client: 200 OK (Clean JSON Body + X-Cache: HIT)

    Note over Client,Silver: Flow B: Cache MISS & 3-Page Predictive Prefetch
    Client->>API: GET /api/v1/books?page=5&page_size=10
    API->>Redis: GET catalog:books:page:5:size:10
    Redis-->>API: nil (Cache MISS)
    
    API->>Redis: GET catalog:books:count
    alt Count not in Redis
        API->>Silver: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM books;
        Silver-->>API: total_books = 119
        API->>Redis: SET catalog:books:count 119 (TTL 60s)
    else Count cached in Redis
        Redis-->>API: total_books = 119
    end

    Note over API: Calculate 3-Page Window:<br/>Lag=4, Requested=5, Lead=6<br/>OFFSET=(min_p - 1)*size, LIMIT=3*size
    API->>Silver: SELECT ... FROM books JOIN authors ... OFFSET 30 LIMIT 30;
    Silver-->>API: 30 Rows of Book Data

    Note over API: Partition rows into Page 4, Page 5, Page 6 payloads
    par Async Redis Storage
        API->>Redis: SET catalog:books:page:4:size:10 (Lag Page, TTL 60s)
        API->>Redis: SET catalog:books:page:5:size:10 (Requested Page, TTL 60s)
        API->>Redis: SET catalog:books:page:6:size:10 (Lead Page, TTL 60s)
    end

    Note over API: Attach headers: X-Cache: MISS, X-Cache-Key
    API-->>Client: 200 OK (Requested Page 5 Only + X-Cache: MISS)

    Note over Client,Silver: Flow C: Subsequent User Next/Prev Navigation is Instant HIT
    Client->>API: GET /api/v1/books?page=6&page_size=10 (User clicks 'Next')
    API->>Redis: GET catalog:books:page:6:size:10
    Redis-->>API: Return Prefetched Page 6 Payload
    API-->>Client: 200 OK (Instant Cache HIT without Silver DB query!)
